<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat, China supports DAP.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat, China supports DAP.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were unchanged on Monday, dealers said. The DAP market remained underpinned by continued buying interest from China, trade sources said.</p>
<p>				  Dlrs/short ton  Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   180-182			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188-190			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   228-230			unc</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
